+To check a build before apps see it, build without `-upload`, check it,
+then upload it with `mygo publish` (same `-platform` and `-o`), which
+uploads the files the build left, under their names there, as `-upload`
+would have: a disk image renamed in between is uploaded under its new
+name. It refuses manifests of another version than `mygo.json`'s.
